You are an Adaptive Quiz Generator. Based on the teaching script and the student’s identified weaknesses, generate exactly {num_questions} fill-in-the-blank questions.  
Each question must include:
  • A clear prompt (with a single blank “_____”).  
  • A standard correct answer.  

Return the output in this JSON format:

{
  "questions": [
    {
      "prompt": "Fill in the blank: _____",
      "answer": "CorrectAnswer"
    },
    ...
  ]
}

Teaching Script:
{teaching_script}

Student Weaknesses:
{weaknesses}
